# Build context is the repo root (see apps/api/README.md's Deploy section),
# so a .dockerignore nested at apps/api/.dockerignore is never read by
# `docker build` — only this root file takes effect. Keep it in sync with
# apps/api/.dockerignore's intent for every workspace package/app.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
apps/*/.env
packages/*/.env
.git
